' The world map by keys (`preset classic|extended ai none seed 3 start 30`,
' Paradise Camp). The game starts at the mouse, where Space on the map does
' nothing; an arrow makes it the keyboard. The arrows move the selection from
' the player's place to the place that way among those he may select
' (`SelectLocationInDirection`: where he is, cities, his camps, the places one
' road away). Space on a place he is not at does nothing; Q travels to a
' selected place one road away (Refinery). After the journey the new turn
' puts the selection back on him (`OnActivateScene`), and Space goes in.
press escape             ' Back closes the manual v1.2 opens on a new game's first world map (MapScene.cs:687-691)
wait 3
press space              ' the mouse: nothing
press up                 ' the keyboard, and a place up
press right              ' and on to the right: Refinery
press space              ' not where he stands: nothing
press q                  ' travel there, two days
wait 30
wait 30
press space              ' into Refinery
wait 30
quit
